  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">Members of the Pioneer Association compiled these notes on the Sentinels on their own initiative, gathering the local chronicles, anecdotes, and folk legends that can still be traced, in the hope of recording and piecing together the Sentinels' past deeds as fully as possible.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">These records contain some speculative conclusions that remain unverified and may require further information to confirm or clarify.<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791734400000/ybezed6jv3gdaisjd8-1791797555598.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791820800000/igmdtb07kyx3jlezni-1791874685147.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791820800000/jsw7q5n91t03u9fitt-1791874702902.png\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791734400000/prrs8nxe6a5kttgi9e-1791797589549.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1067\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791734400000/anbt8pfqikrdfekane-1791797589791.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1272\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1791734400000/lj2ferc5gckynhbua8-1791797589796.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"1434\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n</div>",
